WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
What may this AI remember? Control retrieval, inference, sharing and forgetting.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Define a memory space.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Permit retrieval by context.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Block unapproved inference paths.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Make forgetting enforceable.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Memory is a governed resource.
